<section id="verification" aria-labelledby="vf-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How verification works</p>
      <h2 id="vf-title">Three steps from reservation to verified badge</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>Reserve your handle</h3><p>Tell us your name and member state. We hold <span class="mono">firstname-lastname.rostrum.eu</span> for you until the founding cohort opens.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Confirm it's you</h3><p>We match you against the European Parliament's public list of Members and confirm through your official Parliament email address.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Go live, verified</h3><p>Your badge is issued and recognised network-wide. Bring your Bluesky followers across, invite your team and start posting.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
